if mode playing or menu: streakAcc += dt* (state.speed/140); while>1 spawn.
s.x=rand(roadX+laneW*.2, roadX+roadW-laneW*.2); s.y=-50; s.len=rand(30,90); s.a=rand(.05,.16); 
update y += (state.speed*1.6)*dt.
```
